BRQC KEM - BRQC-512

Directory structure:
  KEM_BRQC-512.h/c           KEM programming interface (API_PKC standard)
  drng.c/h                     Deterministic random number generator SM3-DRBG (API_PKC)
  auxfunc.c/h                  Auxiliary hash functions SM3/pseudohash/pseudoXOF (API_PKC)
  KAT_KEM.c                    Known answer test vector generator (API_PKC)
  main_brqc.c                  Demo program
  src/                         Algorithm implementation sources
    kem.c                      Key encapsulation / decapsulation core logic
    brqc.c                     BRQC PKE encryption / decryption
    parsing.c                  Key / ciphertext serialization
    parameters.h               Algorithm parameters
    gabidulin.*                Gabidulin code
    qpoly.*                    Q-polynomial arithmetic
    rbc-*/                     Finite field arithmetic (core layer)
  lib/                         Internal dependencies
    random_source/             Random source abstraction layer (DRNG backend)
    XKCP/                      Keccak/SHAKE library (used by core layer)
    wrapper/                   Seed expander wrapper

Build:
  make BRQC-512                Build demo program
  make BRQC-512-kat            Build KAT test vector generator
  make BRQC-512-verbose        Build debug version (verbose output)
  make clean                   Clean build artifacts

Generate KAT:
  make BRQC-512-kat && ./bin/BRQC-512-kat
  Test vectors are written to output/KAT_KEM_BRQC-512.txt
